<section id="faq" style="background:#050914;padding:90px 40px;position:relative;">
  <div style="max-width:760px;margin:0 auto;">
    <p class="section-eyebrow" style="text-align:center;">FAQ</p>
    <h2 class="section-heading" style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:40px;">Questions, answered</h2>
    <style>
      .faq-item { border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius:14px; background:rgba(255,255,255,0.02); margin-bottom:12px; overflow:hidden; }
      .faq-item summary { list-style:none; cursor:pointer; padding:20px 22px; font-size:16px; font-weight:600; color:#fff; display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:space-between; gap:16px; }
      .faq-item summary::-webkit-details-marker { display:none; }
      .faq-item summary::after { content:'+'; font-size:22px; font-weight:400; color:#4d9fff; transition:transform 0.2s; flex-shrink:0; }
      .faq-item[open] summary::after { transform:rotate(45deg); }
      .faq-item summary:hover { color:#4d9fff; }
      .faq-answer { padding:0 22px 20px; font-size:14.5px; line-height:1.65; color:rgba(255,255,255,0.6); }
      .faq-answer a { color:#4d9fff; text-decoration:none; }
    </style>

    <details class="faq-item">
      <summary>How does the AI scoring actually work?</summary>
      <div class="faq-answer">You give the engine a role and your candidates (paste résumés or profiles). GPT-4o evaluates each candidate against the role across match, adaptability, and focus — returning a score, a Gold/Silver/Bronze tier, and the reasoning behind every match. If the AI can't produce a genuine result, we tell you honestly rather than showing a made-up number.</div>
    </details>

    <details class="faq-item">
      <summary>Do I need a credit card to start the trial?</summary>
      <div class="faq-answer">Yes. You add a card to start your 7-day free trial, but you're not charged during the trial. Cancel any time before day 7 and you pay nothing.</div>
    </details>

    <details class="faq-item">
      <summary>What happens when my 7-day trial ends?</summary>
      <div class="faq-answer">We email you the day before it ends. If you do nothing, the trial converts to a paid subscription and your card is charged for the first period. If you cancel before day 7, you're not charged at all.</div>
    </details>

    <details class="faq-item">
      <summary>Where do the candidates come from?</summary>
      <div class="faq-answer">Today, from you — paste the candidates or résumés you're considering and the engine scores them against your role. Automated candidate sourcing is on the roadmap; we only advertise what actually works today.</div>
    </details>

    <details class="faq-item">
      <summary>Can I cancel anytime?</summary>
      <div class="faq-answer">Yes — no notice period and no cancellation fee. You keep access until the end of the period you've already paid for, then the account switches to a free read-only state. Your data stays. Plus a <strong>14-day money-back guarantee</strong> — a full refund within 14 days of any charge, no questions asked. See our <a href="/refund">refund policy</a> for details.</div>
    </details>

    <details class="faq-item">
      <summary>How is the Enterprise plan billed?</summary>
      <div class="faq-answer">Enterprise is a custom quote billed by invoice — pay by bank transfer. <a href="mailto:hello@aitmp.io?subject=Enterprise%20Plan%20Inquiry%20-%20AI%20Talent%20Match%20Pro&body=Hi%2C%0A%0AI%27m%20interested%20in%20the%20Enterprise%20plan%20for%20AI%20Talent%20Match%20Pro.%0A%0ACompany%20name%3A%20%0ATeam%20size%3A%20%0ACurrent%20ATS%2FCRM%3A%20%0AWhat%20I%27m%20looking%20for%3A%20%0A%0ABest%20time%20to%20reach%20me%3A%20">Contact us</a> and we'll send you an onboarding form and invoice.</div>
    </details>

    <details class="faq-item">
      <summary>Can I sign in with LinkedIn?</summary>
      <div class="faq-answer">LinkedIn sign-in is coming soon. For now, create your account with your work email — it takes under a minute.</div>
    </details>
  </div>
</section>

